      "problem": "Let $F(x,y)=4\\,i-(2y-3x)\\,j$ and let $C$ be the path defined by $r(t)=⟨t,\\,3t-1⟩$ for $t\\in [0,1].$ Which of the following is equivalent to ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r?$",
